Empty on purpose: Phase 6 (visualizer) populates hand-authored augmentations here. NEVER regenerated. Name is load-bearing — the generated visualizer/index.html carries a relative <script src> to visualizer-augmentations/index.js that only resolves while the two directories are siblings. See ADR .praxia/docs/decisions/260817_repl-layout-and-delivery-mechanism.md §2.1, §4.2 (row 4).
